+// EXPERIMENT: let Python subclass the Irrlicht event receiver.
+// Without directors SWIG wraps IEventReceiver as an abstract class with no
+// constructor, so PyChrono can see the type but cannot implement one -- which
+// is why a Python script cannot read the mouse or keyboard of the Irrlicht
+// window at all, and has to go to the OS behind Chrono's back.
+%feature("director") irr::IEventReceiver;
